  ${ENDPOINT:-<not established>}

Model you have approved in your policy (NOT an Anthropic model):
  $EXP_MODEL

Checks so far:
  VERIFIED:      $n_ver
  FAILED:        $n_fail
  UNSUPPORTED:   $n_unsup
  INFORMATIONAL: $n_info

